message: "If you use this code or the audit results, please cite the paper."
title: "Rank or threshold? Why fake-news detectors fail on new corpora"
abstract: "Code, results and figures for a cross-corpus study of fake-news detectors that splits the macro-F1 lost on a new corpus into a ranking deficit and an operating-point loss, audits ten public corpora, and evaluates label-free repairs such as rate transfer."
